    {
      "id": "static_capacity_abort",
      "status": "CONFIRMED",
      "finding_zh": "四次原生退出均为粗候选计数超过 5×1280=6400；不是超时。固定容量是直接退出条件，超量候选的上游来源尚未全部确定。",
      "evidence": [
        "failure_timeline.json",
        "native/source/src/mirheo/core/bouncers/drivers/common.h"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "write_before_bounds_check",
      "status": "RULED_OUT_WITHIN_SCOPE",
      "finding_zh": "实际 push_back 先以 i<maxSize 保护写入；计数仍递增，随后宿主检查并报错。正常未损坏状态下，单纯超过 6400 不会越界写候选表。",
      "source": "src/mirheo/core/bouncers/drivers/common.h:30"
    },
    {
      "id": "uncleared_accumulating_counter",
      "status": "RULED_OUT_WITHIN_SCOPE",
      "finding_zh": "每次 exec 对粗、精确计数器及碰撞时间清零；同一 stream 内不存在跨调用累计。此结论不排除跨 stream 对共享缓冲的干扰。",
      "source": "src/mirheo/core/bouncers/from_mesh.cu:90"
    },
    {
      "id": "shared_outer_inner_itself",
      "status": "RULED_OUT_WITHIN_SCOPE",
      "finding_zh": "outer、inner 的 local 调用位于同一任务组、同一 stream；共用实例本身不是这两个调用并发的证据。",
      "source": "src/mirheo/core/simulation.cpp:685; src/mirheo/core/task_scheduler.cpp:353"
    },
    {
      "id": "local_halo_scratch_ordering",
      "status": "SUPPORTED_NOT_CONFIRMED",
      "finding_zh": "local 与 halo 任务缺少先后依赖；exec 返回前最后的反弹核异步运行，而空 halo 也清零同一实例的候选表和碰撞时间。源码确认存在无依赖的冲突访问可能；尚未证明它导致了本机这四次失败。",
      "source": "src/mirheo/core/simulation.cpp:1275; src/mirheo/core/bouncers/from_mesh.cu:71; src/mirheo/core/containers.h:553; src/mirheo/core/task_scheduler.cpp:281",
      "prediction": "The last inner local bounce can race with an empty outer halo clear; independent per-PV objects alone do not establish local/halo ordering."
    },
    {
      "id": "detector_false_positive_only",
      "status": "RULED_OUT_WITHIN_SCOPE",
